      "releaseNotes" : "## Smart Groups\n\nThe sidebar has a new **Smart Groups** section: saved, named filters over a project's tasks.\n\nCreate one with \"New Smart Group…\" and combine any of:\n\n- **Status** — blocked, ready, in progress, done, closed\n- **Priority** — low, medium, high\n- **Tags and categories** — comma-separated; a task matches if it has any one of them\n- **Deadline** — only overdue tasks, or only tasks due within a chosen number of days\n- **Text** — matched against title, description, notes, category and tags\n\nCriteria combine the way you'd expect: a group with two tags and two statuses matches tasks that have either tag *and* are in either status. Leave a criterion empty to ignore it.\n\nSelecting a smart group filters exactly as the Focus rows already do — non-matching tasks are dimmed on the graph and hidden from the list, board and timeline. Right-click a group to edit or delete it.\n\nSmart groups belong to a project and sync via iCloud along with everything else.",
